# Frontend (Vue 3 + TypeScript + Vite)

- Composition API `<script setup>`; Vue Router; not Nuxt.
- No client-side analytics formulas — use backend `/api/v1`.
- null/missing ≠ 0; loading/empty/error; incomplete-history warnings.
- Preferred: src/pages, src/components, src/api, src/composables, src/types.
- Details SSOT: trello_analytics_open_spec `.cursor/rules/frontend.mdc` and AGENTS.md.
